@title Cabinet plate: EMC view of a quiet cabinet (engine classes, no finding, nothing alarming drawn)
@area Cabinet
# A motor starter cabinet with only mains wiring: the engine classes the wires, finds nothing, and says so.
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-lesson.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text emc view on the plate
wait 8
key Enter
wait 30
expect "Indicative model"
expect "No finding"
shot plate-emc-quiet
check_layout
